        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38.21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Verses 21–22 are moved here from the end of the chapter (see 2 Kgs 20.6–9).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Isaiah told the king to put a paste made of figs on his boil, and he would get well. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then King Hezekiah asked, “What is the sign to prove that I will be able to go to the Temple?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaiah replied, “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will give you a sign to prove that he will keep his promise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the stairway built by King Ahaz, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will make the shadow go back ten steps.” And the shadow moved back ten steps.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "stairway",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "ten steps",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "steps",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sundial… ten degrees… degrees",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "(see 2 Kgs 20.9–11).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
